<i>♪ One plays with lightning ♪</i>

179
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:42,040
<i>♪ 一个喜欢玩骨头 ♪</i>
<i>♪ The other plays with bones. ♪</i>

180
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,840
老天  这歌屌爆了
Oh, man, that rocks.

181
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,580
还记得《法柜奇兵》第一部吗
Hey, remember The Ark of the Covenant?

182
