最棒的水果是什么
what is the best fruit,

200
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,540
然后我意识到  我想问你的其实是
but then I realized what I want to ask you

201
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:32,780
为什么你的前臂会贴有创口贴
is why is there a Band-Aid on your forearm,

202
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,800
但后来我又意识到  我最想问你的其实是
but then I realized what I really want to ask you is

203
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,920
麻烦你快走好吗
just can you just go?

204
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,470
你很健康
You're healthy.

205
00:08:40,470 --> 00:08:42,220
你从事科学工作
You have a job in the sciences.

206
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:44,910
不得不说  如果信用报告结果良好
I've got to say, if this credit report comes back good,

207
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,520
你就是我的第一人选
you're the frontrunner.

208
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,430
我不会当你的室友  谢尔顿
I'm not gonna be your roommate, Sheldon.

209
00:08:53,830 --> 00:08:55,380
可我见了11个人
But I met with 11 people,

210
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:56,980
最后他们都走了
and they all walked out.

211
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:58,650
那个好莱坞伪君子克里斯·帕拉特
And that Hollywood phony Chris Pratt

212
