217
00:09:10,310 --> 00:09:11,880
我想说那时的我更快乐
I'd say it was a happier time,

218
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:15,210
但当时我没有情感  所以谁知道呢
but I was disengaged from my feelings, so who can tell?

219
00:09:16,810 --> 00:09:18,040
我不知道该怎么帮你
I don't know how to help you.

220
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,220
情感是生活的一部分
You know, feelings are a part of life.

221
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:21,770
过去并非如此
They didn't used to be.

222
