我觉得《绿野仙踪》的中心思想不是这样
I don't think that was the point of the movie.

227
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,640
好吧  那我就像木偶皮诺曹
Fine, then I was like Pinocchio

228
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:40,470
却被混蛋老木匠杰佩托变成了一个真正的男孩
before that jerk Geppetto went and made him a real boy.

229
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:43,020
这话说对了
There you go.

230
00:09:45,130 --> 00:09:46,300
你晚餐想吃什么
So, what are you thinking for dinner?

231
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:47,750
今晚该吃泰国菜
Well, it's Thai food night.

232
00:09:48,010 --> 00:09:49,970
亲爱的  你不跟谢尔顿住一起了
Well, honey, you don't live with Sheldon anymore.

233
00:09:49,970 --> 00:09:52,130
