吃泰国菜怎么样
How about Thai food?

243
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,840
太好了
Oh, thank God

244
00:10:12,660 --> 00:10:14,600
我们要去吃晚餐  你要一起吗
Hey, we're going to dinner. You want to come?

245
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,110
我也想去
Oh, I wish I could,

246
00:10:16,110 --> 00:10:19,380
但我意识到最近我情感太脆弱了
but I realized I've become too emotionally vulnerable,

247
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:21,450
所以就像一个操作系统
so, like an operating system,

248
00:10:21,450 --> 00:10:24,490
我要把我的人生还原到前一个稳定的版本
I'm restoring my life to the last stable version,

249
00:10:24,490 --> 00:10:27,620
也就是回到2003年我遇到莱纳德的前一天
which was in 2003, the day before I met Leonard.

250
00:10:29,710 --> 00:10:30,640
他的意思是不去
You heard him, no.

251
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,070
等等
Hang on.

252
00:10:32,070 --> 00:10:34,610
你真的认为现在是2003年吗
Wait, you actually think it's 2003?

253
00:10:34,610 --> 00:10:37,720
不啊  我像12年前那样生活
No, just because I'm living my life like it was 12 years ago

254
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,330
并不代表我有妄想症
doesn't mean I'm delusional.

255
00:10:39,330 --> 00:10:41,180
而且既然是2003年
And since it is 2003,

256
00:10:41,180 --> 00:10:42,490
咱俩不认识
I don't know who you are,

257
00:10:42,490 --> 00:10:44,410
所以请快离开这里
so please exit the premises

258
00:10:44,410 --> 00:10:48,040
否则我可要用我时髦的翻盖手机报警了
before I call the police on my stylish new flip phone.

259
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,890
你还好吧
Are you doing okay?

260
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,510
还行
