265
00:11:10,810 --> 00:11:12,100
但愿吧
I hope so.

266
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,900
不然你能干嘛  搬回去跟他住吗
What else can you do? Move back in with him?

267
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:16,360
当然不是  我只是觉得内疚
No, of course not. I-I just feel bad.

268
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,750
