281
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:46,520
等他所在的那个宇宙发明了iPhone就行了
you know, once iPhones are invented in his universe.

282
00:11:50,110 --> 00:11:53,190
真不敢相信谢尔顿让你当他的室友
I can't believe Sheldon asked you to be his roommate.

283
