288
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,830
能存活多久
before you got one.

289
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:10,350
抱歉
I'm sorry.

290
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:11,360
我只是以为你的生活
I just thought you might have

291
