294
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:22,650
我觉得叫他怪胎不太公平吧
I think calling him a weirdo is a little unfair.

295
00:12:22,650 --> 00:12:25,650
你好  2003年
Hello, 2003!

296
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:29,060
我们给你打包了泰国菜
Hey, we brought you Thai.

297
00:12:31,890 --> 00:12:32,990
东西都哪去了
Where is everything?

298
00:12:32,990 --> 00:12:35,050
于我来说  是在我的未来
In my present, it's in the future.

299
00:12:35,050 --> 00:12:37,740
于你来说  是在你的卧室
In your present, it's been crammed in the bedroom

300
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:38,960
我让那位在家具店停车场认识的
by an enterprising young man

301
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:41,670
有干劲的年轻人全塞进去了
I met in The Home Depot parking lot.

302
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,440
我知道你在干什么
I know what you're doing.

303
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,270
你想引起我们的注意  让我们对你心生内疚
You're trying to get attention so we'll feel bad for you,

304
00:12:46,270 --> 00:12:47,640
但这没有用
but it's not happening.

305
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,780
不  我是在努力搞清
No, what I'm doing is trying to figure out

306
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:52,350
自己该如何生活  因为大家都离我而去
how to live my life now that everyone is leaving me.

307
00:12:52,350 --> 00:12:54,780
你歇歇吧  我们就住在对门
Will you knock it off? We're across the hall.

308
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:58,140
用现在孩子们的说法"懒得鸟你"
As the kids are saying today, "Talk to the hand."

309
