但是我想不出跟滚石押韵的词
but I couldn't rhyme anything with boulder.

319
00:13:30,970 --> 00:13:32,970
诚实  结实
Colder, shoulder,

320
00:13:32,970 --> 00:13:34,370
钻石  宝石
soldier, folder...

321
00:13:34,370 --> 00:13:36,270
对对对
Right, yeah, right.

322
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:37,690
但是
But...

323
00:13:37,690 --> 00:13:39,250
你觉得如何
what do you think?

324
00:13:39,250 --> 00:13:41,130
我觉得非常可爱
I think it's very cute.

325
