好吧  不可爱
Okay, fine, it's not cute.

328
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,750
你就实话实说  你不喜欢
Just be honest. You don't like it.

329
00:13:51,750 --> 00:13:53,550
我没有这么说
I didn't say that.

330
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:55,880
我只是喜欢可以跳舞的音乐
I-I just like music you can dance to.

331
