这首歌也可以跳舞啊
You can dance to this!

332
00:13:59,610 --> 00:14:02,310
<i>♪ 雷神索尔和博士琼斯 ♪ </i>
<i>♪ Thor and Dr. Jones ♪ </i>

333
00:14:02,310 --> 00:14:04,660
<i>♪ 雷神索尔和博士琼斯 ♪</i>
<i>♪ Thor and Dr. Jones ♪</i>

334
00:14:04,660 --> 00:14:05,940
<i>♪ 一个喜欢玩闪电 ♪</i>
<i>♪ One plays with lightning ♪</i>

335
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:08,780
<i>♪ 一个喜欢玩骨头 ♪</i>
<i>♪ The other plays with bones. ♪</i>

336
00:14:10,930 --> 00:14:13,020
我跟你说  哥们  这首歌没动感
I'm telling you, dude, the song has no groove.

337
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,750
不能随着跳舞
You can't dance to it.

338
