谁在乎啊
Who cares?

339
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,640
我还以为月球足迹乐队
I thought the whole point of Footprints on the Moon

340
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:21,350
主要是写出能让人思考的歌
was to write songs that make people think.

341
00:14:21,350 --> 00:14:22,800
两者皆可顾啊
You can do both,

342
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:25,130
就像迈克·杰克逊的《比莉·珍》
like Michael Jackson's "Billie Jean."

343
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,990
你会一边跳舞一边思考
While you're dancing you're thinking, like,

344
00:14:26,990 --> 00:14:29,780
"靠  歌词唱的小孩到底是谁的"
"Darn it, whose baby is it?"

345
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,920
你这想法都打哪儿来的
Where's this coming from?

346
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:35,200
几个小时前  我们都很爱这首歌
A few hours ago, we both loved this song.

347
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,470
我还是爱啊
I still love it.

348
00:14:36,470 --> 00:14:39,070
只是认为它有进步的空间而已
I just think there's room for improvement.

349
00:14:39,770 --> 00:14:41,550
你唱给艾米丽听了  对不对
You played it for Emily, didn't you?

350
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,820
对  那又怎样
Yeah, so what?

351
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:43,960
你这个妻管严
You are such a wimp.

352
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,720
她不喜欢  你就也不喜欢了
She didn't like it, now you don't like it.

353
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:48,760
不  只是我这个音乐人在进步
No, no. I'm just evolving as a musician.

354
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:51,040
而你却停在过去止步不前
You're the one who's stuck in the past.

355
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:54,320
你说的过去就是一顿午饭前
